"00:00" = "This number clearly indicates that a transition is coming in your life: zeroing and leaving something old and unnecessary in the past and the beginning of a new life cycle and period. You are now synchronized with the universe and the number encourages you to leave something and think about what you would really like and what it would be worth starting to move towards your intended goal. Higher powers favor you in your new endeavors.";
"01:01" = "The angels are trying to convey to you that there are a lot of doubts and hesitations in your life, no matter what issue it concerns. You need to somewhat stabilize your inner supports and understand what you really want. You need to decide and put in order the emotional background, focusing on your inner world. Your introspection will be especially productive.";
"02:02" = "In your life, it is quite likely that an ally, partner, comrade-in-arms will appear, that is, some kind of support. You can meet the love of your life, or find yourself a good loyal friend, or form a great business partnership that will bring improvement and success in business affairs. One goes fast and two go far.";
"03:03" = "The message of the number is that you have a great opportunity to overcome obstacles and come to success. You are an honest, generous, happy and strong person - this set of qualities will allow you to become aware of yourself and your life. Trust your feelings, they will help build your life in harmony with yourself. Your intuition is sharpened now.";
"04:04" = "The number indicates to you the direction you have chosen correctly. It can also talk about impending troubles, but if you keep your life in your hands and under control, you will solve these difficulties. Everything will work out if you work hard. Patience and scrupulousness will be true allies for you in achievements and life in general. Therefore, do not give up so as not to miss the important for you and new opportunities.";
"05:05" = "The angels are sending you a sign of a major change in your life. The main thing for you is to remain calm and balanced. Some moments will be completely out of your power and you need to adequately accept them. Be reasonable and take a mostly observant position. Do not take risks and approach the upcoming changes judiciously.";
"06:06" = "The number is pushing you to change your life priorities, you need to take care of spiritual development and move yourself a little away from the material ones. Pay attention to inner harmony, love and eternal beauty, creation. Also, this number can serve as a sign that soon you can meet a fateful person for yourself, which will significantly raise the level of your soul.";
"07:07" = "This is a sign of good luck coming into your life. An Angel protects you and leads you to a better life for you. You will soon begin to receive surprises from the Universe, support, a harvest from what you have invested your efforts in. It is possible that your cherished dream may come true or you will meet true love for yourself.";
"08:08" = "The angels send you information that you are moving towards material prosperity and prosperity. You are waiting for good financial prospects and gaining solid stability. You will definitely come to success in business and material matters and to prosperity. And now is the time to focus on a solid foundation for yourself for the future.";
"09:09" = "This number can indicate to you the presence of a burden, a heaviness that can stop you in creative and spiritual manifestations. You can bear an excessive share of responsibility and obligations that bind your hands. Angels bring you a sign of purification and liberation and will help you in this, to remove a heavy burden that caused a lot of discomfort.";
"10:10" = "Expect changes in your life as a result of past decisions and actions taken. There are natural results of the steps taken earlier in your life. Be prepared to prioritize yourself and adjust to your new existence. And the main thing for you now is caution.";
"11:11" = "Successful and successful change is about to burst into your life. You will get the result that you expected and to which you aspired. You will be proud of your own achievements. Your work and patience will soon bring you a well-deserved reward and will pay off handsomely. Your actions will now be as effective as possible.";
"12:12" = "The angels are sending you a sign that it is time to visit the place of your spiritual fulfillment and express your desires to the Universe. This is a sign of fruitful interaction and association - with higher powers, with people sent to you from above, with nature. A fruitful union will help you achieve your goals and objectives better and better.";
"13:13" = "This number symbolizes you about control and management. You need to take everything into your own hands and under your sensitive guidance. Both life circumstances and emotions, feelings and your thoughts need control. If there are debts and obligations in your life, then you should close and pay them off, at least pay attention to them and take steps to resolve them.";
"14:14" = "The angels are sending you information that you need to show your leadership qualities and focus your attention on the tasks at hand. And also the number can talk about your need for rest and a change of scenery. Go on a journey - it will have a very beneficial effect on you.";
"15:15" = "This message wants to tell you about the need for your support and help from your loved ones and relatives. Someone really needs you right now and you should give it time and attention. You can also unexpectedly receive recognition of feelings.";
"16:16" = "The sign is not very favorable and may indicate future troubles. Keep a balanced state and do not forget to be a generous person towards the world. The angel encourages you to share despite the circumstances: knowledge, skills, feelings, experience, material resources.";
"17:17" = "The value of this number symbolizes growth in the financial sector and an increase in your income. New acquaintances and communication with interesting people will help improve your financial condition. The number promises success and prosperity, but do not be overly focused on the material forms of manifestation of this world and do not forget about the soul.";
"18:18" = "This number symbolizes the opening inside of you of a new, hidden, unrecognized and unfamiliar. New talents can be revealed in you, you can start new relationships, unexpectedly receive an inheritance. You need to learn to let go - a person, an environment, an old job that does not satisfy you. Let go of the past and the new will not keep you waiting.";
"19:19" = "Pay attention to your creativity. You could have accumulated a lot of ideas and energy that needs to be released and implemented. Your emotional background can be somewhat increased and by properly directing it, you will avoid unpleasant consequences in the form of unrestrained and impulsive actions.";
"20:20" = "This is the number of peace, light and spiritual harmony. If you were in a quarrel with someone, then you can reconcile and thereby find peace. Angels remind you that the peace of loved ones is more important than many other material aspects. They can support you, as well as your friends or strangers, be open and grateful. They can also send a message that you are working very hard. Find time for rest and for yourself, otherwise you risk losing everything out of hand due to fatigue.";
"21:21" = "The number can in some way indicate to you the right choice and remind you that the time has come to make a decision and decide. If you do not make your choice soon, inaction and uncertainty are fraught with trouble later. Be self-confident and independent, starting from this.";
"22:22" = "The number marks balance, balance and harmony. Be wise and make informed decisions. Your actions must be thoughtful, consistent and rational. It's time for you to think about the next steps and changes. You can direct your life in the direction you need through your awareness and life experience.";
"23:23" = "The angels point out to you the need for introspection and planning for your own life. Success will favor you, provided that you are open to new acquaintances and events, using your past experience. They can also suggest a meeting with an unpleasant person. You need to carefully analyze your surroundings and understand who you can trust and who you should not.";

